<title>POLAND: Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight stocks fell, six rose and five were flat in 30.5-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Thursday with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,785.7 points, 1.6 percent higher than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining three stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 0.9 percent to 163.5 zlotys in a 15-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
